BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316359914@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041734Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T113000
SUMMARY:Verona Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK\n\nWe will meet at the benche
 s in front of the boathouse.\n\nWe will walk the loop around the park. The
  goal will be at least three miles\, but there is plenty of opportunity to
  stop or continue to fit your personal goals.\n\nWe will be walking on a p
 aved surface.\n\nWe walk at a medium speed.\n\nPlease plan to arrive 5 min
 utes **early** so that we can **start on time.**\n\nVerona Park is 54.32 a
 cres with a lake running through it. It is bordered by Lakeside and Bloomf
 ield Avenues in the southern part of Verona. It is the fifth largest park 
 in the Essex County system\, making it a great place to walk.\n\nDisclaime
 r: If you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible 
 for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable 
 in case of injury or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extrem
 e weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316359914/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260831T200116Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T200116Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316039129@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041734Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T110000
SUMMARY:🚶Yanticaw Park Nutley
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nMeet along Park Drive in Nutley near the Orechio
  Sports Complex. We'll walk about 3.5 mile through scenic Yanticaw Park\, 
 up to Kingsland St. and back. The path is paved and mostly flat.\n\nPlease
  check the event page beforehand in case of any changes. Inclement weather
  will cancel the walk.\n\nThe Yanticaw Park is an Essex County-owned park 
 in Nutley\, New Jersey. It is located between Centre Street and Chestnut S
 treet\, extending west to Passaic Avenue.\n\nEssex County began purchasing
  land in 1911 for creation of the park. Wetlands in the park were drained\
 , and a dam was set up to form a lake. The park was completed in 1914. In 
 1962\, the lake\, containing a small island was drained and a channel was 
 dug as a continuation of the natural third river from the south.\n\nPLEASE
  ARRIVE 5 MINUTES **EARLY** SO WE CAN START TO WALK ON TIME\n\nDisclaimer:
  If you join us for a walk/hike\, please understand that you are responsib
 le for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liab
 le in case of injury or mishap. Walk/hike will be canceled in the event of
  extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316039129/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260809T013220Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T013220Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316231596@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041734Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316231596/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260822T203035Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260822T203035Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
